      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Shortcuts",
      "source_hash": 1681433054797948056,
      "context_hash": 10257566642089897904,
      "translation": "단축 명령어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730622Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Shortcuts are simple commands for performing common tasks.",
      "source_hash": 11827968199177704507,
      "context_hash": 321726795927271662,
      "translation": "단축 명령어는 흔히 수행하는 작업을 위한 간단한 명령어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 15490309734712046470,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Shortcut commands can be issued by writing a GitHub comment as indicated below.",
      "source_hash": 13189619414926593966,
      "context_hash": 8818956983014062592,
      "translation": "단축 명령어는 아래에 표시된 대로 GitHub 댓글을 작성하여 실행할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "ready",
      "source_hash": 17171380516818028527,
      "context_hash": 5142519662546668008,
      "translation": "ready",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot ready`",
      "source_hash": 13626095579548298762,
      "context_hash": 17919117943519374673,
      "translation": "`@rustbot ready`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This indicates that a PR is ready for review.",
      "source_hash": 11799989709312540301,
      "context_hash": 15994255163845387824,
      "translation": "이는 PR이 리뷰 준비가 되었음을 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This assigns the `S-waiting-on-review` label on the pull request and removes both `S-waiting-on-author` and `S-blocked` if present.",
      "source_hash": 15929590444501421426,
      "context_hash": 261836973833500408,
      "translation": "이는 풀 리퀘스트에 `S-waiting-on-review` 레이블을 지정하고, `S-waiting-on-author`와 `S-blocked`가 있다면 둘 다 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트",
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:28.553550Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot review` or `@rustbot reviewer` are aliases for `ready`.",
      "source_hash": 11586224116521063956,
      "context_hash": 14702206459293968197,
      "translation": "`@rustbot review` 또는 `@rustbot reviewer`는 `ready`의 별칭입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "author",
      "source_hash": 8968782384519995461,
      "context_hash": 8292033299193285057,
      "translation": "author",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot author`",
      "source_hash": 6134291482749717436,
      "context_hash": 6791528423903198899,
      "translation": "`@rustbot author`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730623Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "This indicates that a PR is waiting on the author.",
      "source_hash": 8892062998813748413,
      "context_hash": 4963310138367857001,
      "translation": "이는 PR이 작성자의 응답을 기다리고 있음을 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "This assigns the `S-waiting-on-author` label on the pull request and removes both `S-waiting-on-review` and `S-blocked` if present.",
      "source_hash": 9907740293444867750,
      "context_hash": 10706764401349549708,
      "translation": "이는 풀 리퀘스트에 `S-waiting-on-author` 레이블을 지정하고, `S-waiting-on-review`와 `S-blocked`가 있다면 둘 다 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트",
        "label": "레이블"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:28.553552Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "blocked",
      "source_hash": 18327428354696644260,
      "context_hash": 17164955611649098801,
      "translation": "blocked",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "`@rustbot blocked`",
      "source_hash": 17689743790481177363,
      "context_hash": 10223346983790618565,
      "translation": "`@rustbot blocked`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "This indicates that a PR is blocked on something.",
      "source_hash": 12392452080099149829,
      "context_hash": 11895338836153624698,
      "translation": "이는 PR이 무언가에 의해 막혀 있음을 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:46:40.730624Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "This assigns the `S-blocked` label on the pull request and removes both `S-waiting-on-author` and `S-waiting-on-review` if present.",
      "source_hash": 1718871789788329863,
      "context_hash": 13097477479403489776,
      "translation": "이는 풀 리퀘스트에 `S-blocked` 레이블을 지정하고, `S-waiting-on-author`와 `S-waiting-on-review`가 있다면 둘 다 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "label": "레이블",
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:28.553553Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
